					"id": 721110301,
					"content": "这个是…咳，你又是从哪里捡到的？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721110302,
						721110304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "绀田传助"
				},
				{
					"id": 721110302,
					"content": "沟渠的下游。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721110303
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721110303,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721110306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "绀田传助"
				},
				{
					"id": 721110306,
					"content": "总之，你也没有证据证明 ，这两件东西之间有什么关联。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721110307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "绀田传助"
				},
				{
					"id": 721110307,
					"content": "关联是有的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721110308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 721110308,
					"content": "莫名其妙，这能有什么关联？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721110309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "绀田传助"
				},
				{
					"id": 721110309,
					"content": "摩拉上，难不成还能有什么暗号？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721110310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "绀田传助"
				},
				{
					"id": 721110310,
					"content": "摩拉上确实没有，但别的地方有。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721110311
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 721110311,
					"content": "那就是我们在货车残骸附近找到的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": []
				},
				{
					"id": 721110304,
					"content": "在村口的树梢上捡到的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721110305
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721110305,
					"content": "这怎么可能…你这样试探我是没用的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721110306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "绀田传助"
				}
			]
		},
